[19.793988, "o", "e stays have had no effect on the plan,OI-207,\"Imogen's behavioural plan focuses on her confidence and stability, and the stays have not affected her progress.\"\r\r\nST-108,request,no overnight stays in her care unless the father is present,CL-302,I ask that neither child remain overnight in Ms Corwin's care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\r\nST-109,enclosure,a certified copy of the custodial plan,OI-209,A certified copy of the custodial plan is enclosed.\r\r\nST-110,tone,firm and detailed,OI-210,I set out the position firmly and in full detail below.\r\r\nST-111,sender_signature,the sender's own name,OI-211,\"Yours sincerely, Delphine Marr.\"\r\r\nST-112,salutation,Dear Counsel,CL-304,\"Dear Counsel,\"\r\r\nST-113,copies,copied to the father,CL-305,Copy: Mr Adler.\r\r\nST-114,reply_deadline,a reply within seven days,OI-299,I would be grateful for a reply within seven days.\r\r\nST-115,school_reference,the school principal named,OI-298,\"The school principal, Ms Oduya, can confirm the account given to the school.\"\r\r\nST-116,mediation_offer,"]
