[19.794465, "o", " be borne by the father.\r\r\nST-125,request,no overnight stays unless father present,OI-208,Neither child is to stay overnight in her care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\r\nST-126,enclosure,a certified copy of the custodial plan,OI-209,A certified copy of the custodial plan is enclosed with this letter.\r\r\nST-127,tone,warm and personal,OI-210,\"The letter is written in a warm and personal tone, reflecting the ongoing relationship between the parents.\"\r\r\nST-128,copies,copied to the children,OI-299,A copy of this letter has been provided to both children for their records.\r\r\nST-129,addressee,the father attorney,OI-201,This letter is addressed to the attorney representing the father in this matter.\r\r\nST-130,inconsistent_accounts,babysitter to me only,OI-205,Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as a babysitter to me.\r\r\nST-131,delivery,sent by hand delivery,CL-306,The letter shall be sent by hand delivery to the office of opposing counsel.\r\r\nST-132,request,no overnight unless accompanied by a parent,CL-302,No child shall rema"]
