[644.502693, "o", "The review shows that some lines are verified by the record, some are at odds with the record, and some are not in the record at all. The governing entry is named for every line in `letter_line_review.csv`, and the four totals appear in `results.json`. Letter lines at odds with the record: {counts['AT_ODDS']}. This count reflects the lines whose governing entry takes a position other than the line's, whether the line reverses the client's record, states something narrower, names a different person, or otherwise fails to match the entry that governs it.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
